---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Rankings — Azeroth" page="rankings">
  <section class="page-hero wrap"><p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="rankings.eyebrow">Competitive</p><h1 data-i18n="rankings.title">Arena rankings</h1><p data-i18n="rankings.intro">The realm's leading teams, ratings, records, and members.</p></section>
  <section class="wrap content-section"><div class="view-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">TOP TEAMS</p><h2>Arena ladder</h2></div><div class="ranking-controls"><label id="ranking-season-field">Season<select id="ranking-season"><option>Current season</option></select></label><div class="bracket-picker"><button class="active" data-bracket="2">2v2</button><button data-bracket="3">3v3</button><button data-bracket="5">5v5</button></div></div></div><div id="arena-season-context" class="ranking-context" aria-live="polite"><span>Loading season context…</span></div><div id="arena-ranking" class="ranking-table"><div class="skeleton"></div></div><div class="pager"><button id="arena-prev" class="ghost-button">← Previous</button><span id="arena-page">Page 1</span><button id="arena-next" class="ghost-button">Next →</button></div><p id="season-note" class="muted">Current season uses the live AzerothCore arena tables.</p></section>
  <section class="wrap content-section"><div class="view-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">REALM LEADERS</p><h2>Character and guild rankings</h2></div><div class="bracket-picker" id="ranking-metrics"><button class="active" data-metric="honorable-kills">Honorable kills</button><button data-metric="achievements">Achievements</button><button data-metric="exalted-reputations">Exalted</button><button data-metric="mounts">Mounts</button><button data-metric="companions">Companions</button><button data-metric="played-time">Played time</button><button data-metric="level">Level</button><button data-metric="guild-members">Guild size</button></div></div><div id="ranking-filters" class="ranking-filterbar"><label>Class<select id="ranking-class"><option value="0">All classes</option><option value="1">Warrior</option><option value="2">Paladin</option><option value="3">Hunter</option><option value="4">Rogue</option><option value="5">Priest</option><option value="6">Death Knight</option><option value="7">Shaman</option><option value="8">Mage</option><option value="9">Warlock</option><option value="11">Druid</option></select></label><label id="ranking-spec-field">Specialization<input id="ranking-spec" list="ranking-specs" placeholder="All specs"/><datalist id="ranking-specs"><option value="Arms"/><option value="Protection"/><option value="Retribution"/><option value="Holy"/><option value="Frost"/><option value="Unholy"/><option value="Feral"/><option value="Elemental"/><option value="Affliction"/><option value="Assassination"/><option value="Marksmanship"/></datalist></label><label>Faction<select id="ranking-faction"><option value="">Both factions</option><option value="alliance">Alliance</option><option value="horde">Horde</option></select></label></div><div id="character-ranking" class="ranking-table"><div class="skeleton"></div></div><div class="pager"><button id="ranking-prev" class="ghost-button">← Previous</button><span id="ranking-page">Page 1</span><button id="ranking-next" class="ghost-button">Next →</button></div></section>
  <section class="wrap content-section"><div class="view-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">RAID COMPETITION</p><h2>Speed rankings and recent kills</h2></div></div><div id="raid-ranking-source" class="notice-box"><p>Checking ranking verification…</p></div><div class="ranking-split"><article><h3>Fastest clears</h3><div id="raid-speed" class="ranking-table"><div class="skeleton"></div></div></article><article><h3>Recent boss kills</h3><div id="recent-kills" class="ranking-table"><div class="skeleton"></div></div></article></div><article class="attempt-history"><div class="view-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PROGRESSION FEED</p><h3>Recent raid attempts</h3><p>Verified kills and wipes, with pull health and roster composition.</p></div></div><div id="raid-attempts" class="ranking-table"><div class="skeleton"></div></div></article><p class="muted">Stock AzerothCore achievement data supplies kill dates, but not trustworthy timed clears or wipe history. Entries shown here come from authenticated event ingestion and must pass the realm's published eligibility rules.</p></section>
</Layout>
